 "html": "<section>\n  <h1>🎯 重难点 · 高频考点导航</h1>\n  <p>初赛考点看似多，其实<strong>分值与失分高度集中</strong>。下面把全部 <b>77</b> 个考点按三级归类，并给出近 5 年高频 Top 榜。<strong>优先吃透「拉分难点」、扫清「易错陷阱」，再把「必拿分」稳稳收下</strong>，90 分触手可及。</p>\n  <div>\n    <div><b>29</b><span>必拿分（基础必背）</span></div>\n    <div><b>73</b><span>拉分难点（理解为主）</span></div>\n    <div><b>15</b><span>易错陷阱（最易丢分）</span></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- 一级：必拿分 -->\n<section>\n  <div>\n    <div><span>✅</span><div><h2>一级 · 必拿分（基础必背，务必全对）</h2><p>这些题属于\"会了就送分\"，占选择题约 40%，是冲 90 分的底盘。</p></div></div>\n    <div><div>①计算机基础</div><div><a href=\"knowledge/logic/base_system.php\">进制与数制系统</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/binary_convert.php\">进制互化</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/boolean_logic.php\">逻辑运算与真值表</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/hardware_software.php\">硬件/软件系统</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/security_copyright.php\">信息安全与知识产权</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/data_structure.php\">数据结构基础</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/encoding.php\">信息编码 ASCII/Unicode</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/history_arch.php\">计算机发展史与体系结构</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/os_compile.php\">操作系统与编译基础</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/multimedia.php\">多媒体与图像基础</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/database_basic.php\">数据库常识</a><a href=\"knowledge/logic/sort_stability.php\">排序算法与稳定性</a></div></div><div><div>②C++语法</div><div><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/datatype_range.php\">数据类型与取值范围</a><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/control_flow.php\">分支与循环控制</a><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/array_string.php\">数组与字符串</a><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/struct_sort.php\">结构体与排序</a></div></div><div><div>③算法</div><div><a href=\"knowledge/algo/simulation.php\">模拟算法</a><a href=\"knowledge/algo/enumeration.php\">枚举算法</a><a href=\"knowledge/algo/sorting.php\">排序算法</a></div></div><div><div>④数学</div><div><a href=\"knowledge/math/modular.php\">模运算</a><a href=\"knowledge/math/gcd_lcm.php\">最大公约数与最小公倍数</a><a href=\"knowledge/math/prime_sieve.php\">质数与筛法</a><a href=\"knowledge/math/combinatorics.php\">排列组合</a><a href=\"knowledge/math/proposition.php\">逻辑命题与证明</a></div></di