/10/16 互转必须秒出</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/logic/complement_code.php\">原码/反码/补码</a><span>负数补码、加减运算、溢出判断高频</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/loop_trap.php\">循环常见陷阱</a><span>边界、i++ 次序、死循环，阅读程序 60% 失分点</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/recursion.php\">函数与递归</a><span>递归过程跟踪、返回值、爆栈判断</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/algo/dp_basic.php\">递推与简单 DP</a><span>填表过程、背包倒序，阅读/填空常客</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/algo/binary_search.php\">二分查找</a><span>边界 while 条件、mid 更新，完善程序高频</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/algo/dfs_bfs.php\">DFS 与 BFS</a><span>搜索遍历顺序、vis 标记、状态数</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/math/combinatorics.php\">排列组合</a><span>选择题速解主力，C(n,k)、插板法</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/math/modular.php\">模运算</a><span>同余、快速幂取模、负余数</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/algo/greedy.php\">贪心算法</a><span>贪心正确性判断、与 DP 区分</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/logic/complexity.php\">时间/空间复杂度</a><span>主定理、递归式、循环层数判断</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/math/prime_sieve.php\">质数与筛法</a><span>埃氏筛、欧拉筛、质数判定</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/algo/binary_answer.php\">二分答案</a><span>最大最小/最小最大优化，阅读/填空高频拉分</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"knowledge/cpp/debug_runtime.php\">调试与常见错误</a><span>未初始化/越界/UB，阅读程序当人肉调试器</span></li>\n    </ol>\n    <p><a href=\"exam.php\">📝 学完去全真模考自测</a> <a href=\"daily.php\">📅 每日10题打卡</a> <a href=\"sprint.php\">⚡ 7天冲刺题单</a> <a href=\"knowledge/paper/error_collection.php\">📕 看高频错题合集</a></p>\n  </div>\n</section>"
